{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][The water runs black at your feet as you rinse off the blood and grime clinging to your flesh.][/nomarkup] 
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][You can see a silhouette through the shower curtain. BANG BANG BANG.][/nomarkup] 
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][You can hear a pounding on the bathroom wall and feel your body tense. A wild, surging fear claws at you as you feel danger coming in all around you.][/nomarkup] 
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][Prickles of water against your skin, the flaking of drywall above you, the shouting from beyond the curtain, a standing shadow that is taller than you from your seated position in the shower.][/nomarkup] 
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][You feel a burning in your throat, in your eyes, and an itch in your hands. The shower is coated in blood, and you can feel bits of skin with muscle attached floating past your foot.][/nomarkup] 
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][You have to defend yourself or you're going to die in here.][/nomarkup] 
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][Your eyes flash with an image of yourself in Diego's place.][/nomarkup] #line:0a3368d
<<set $showerTaken to true>>
<<jump showerKnock>>
